0ed para que puedas comprender mejor qu\u00e9 tal lo han hecho. \u00a1Sube alguno!\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Videos module is empty\\u0004Your most viewed {{link}}video stats{{\\\/link}} will show up here.\":[\"Las {{link}}estad\u00edsticas de los v\u00eddeos{{\\\/link}} con m\u00e1s visualizaciones aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for the Posts & Pages when the module has data\\u0004Learn about your most {{link}}popular authors{{\\\/link}} to better understand how they contribute to grow your site.\":[\"Descubre cu\u00e1les son los {{link}}autores m\u00e1s populares{{\\\/link}} para comprender mejor c\u00f3mo contribuyen al crecimiento de tu sitio.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for the Posts & Pages when the module has data\\u0004Most viewed posts, pages, and archives. {{link}}Learn about what content resonates the most{{\\\/link}}.\":[\"Las p\u00e1ginas, entradas y archivos m\u00e1s vistos. {{link}}Descubre qu\u00e9 contenido resuena m\u00e1s con tu audiencia{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for the Posts & Pages when the module has data\\u0004{{link}}Posts and pages{{\\\/link}} sorted by most visited. Learn about what content resonates the most.\":[\"Las {{link}}p\u00e1ginas y entradas{{\\\/link}} ordenadas de m\u00e1s a menos visitas. Descubre qu\u00e9 contenido resuena m\u00e1s con tu audiencia.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Authors module is empty\\u0004Learn about your most {{link}}popular authors{{\\\/link}} to better understand how they contribute to grow your site.\":[\"Descubre cu\u00e1les son los {{link}}autores m\u00e1s populares{{\\\/link}} para comprender mejor c\u00f3mo contribuyen al crecimiento de tu sitio.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Authors module is empty\\u0004{{link}}Traffic that authors have generated{{\\\/link}} will show here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed estar\u00e1 el {{link}}tr\u00e1fico que han generado los autores{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for the Clicks module when it has data\\u0004Most {{link}}clicked external links{{\\\/link}} to track engaging content.\":[\"Los {{link}}enlaces externos con m\u00e1s clics{{\\\/link}} para hacer un seguimiento del contenido que m\u00e1s interesa.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Clicks module is empty\\u0004Your most {{link}}clicked external links{{\\\/link}} will display here to track engaging content.\":[\"Los {{link}}enlaces externos con m\u00e1s clics{{\\\/link}} aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed para hacer un seguimiento del contenido que m\u00e1s interesa.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Clicks module is empty\\u0004Your most {{link}}clicked external links{{\\\/link}} will display here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed aparecer\u00e1n los {{link}}enlaces externos donde m\u00e1s se ha hecho clic{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Comments module is empty\\u0004Learn about the {{link}}comments{{\\\/link}} your site receives by authors, posts, and pages.\":[\"Inf\u00f3rmate sobre los {{link}}comentarios{{\\\/link}} que recibe tu sitio por autores, p\u00e1ginas y entradas.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for Countries module when the module has data\\u0004Stats on visitors and their {{link}}viewing location{{\\\/link}}.\":[\"Estad\u00edsticas sobre los visitantes y su {{link}}ubicaci\u00f3n{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for Countries module when the module has data\\u0004Visitors\u2019 {{link}}viewing location{{\\\/link}} by countries, regions and cities.\":[\"{{link}}Ubicaci\u00f3n{{\\\/link}} de los visitantes por pa\u00eds, regi\u00f3n y ciudad.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Countries module is empty\\u0004Stats on visitors and their {{link}}viewing location{{\\\/link}} will appear here to learn from where you are getting visits.\":[\"Las estad\u00edsticas de los visitantes y su {{link}}ubicaci\u00f3n{{\\\/link}} aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed para que sepas de d\u00f3nde vienen.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Countries module is empty\\u0004Stats on visitors and {{link}}their viewing location{{\\\/link}} will appear here.\":[\"En esta secci\u00f3n estar\u00e1n las estad\u00edsticas de los visitantes y la {{link}}ubicaci\u00f3n desde donde te ven{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Info popover content when the Devices module has data.\\u0004The {{link}}devices and browsers{{\\\/link}} your visitors use to access your website.\":[\"Los {{link}}dispositivos y navegadores{{\\\/link}} que utilizan tus visitantes para acceder a tu web.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Devices module is empty\\u0004The {{link}}devices and browsers{{\\\/link}} your visitors use to access your site will display here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed podr\u00e1s ver los {{link}}dispositivos y navegadores{{\\\/link}} que utilizan tus visitantes para acceder a tu sitio.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Devices module is empty\\u0004Stats on visitors and {{link}}their viewing device{{\\\/link}} will appear here.\":[\"Las estad\u00edsticas de visitantes y {{link}}sus dispositivos de visualizaci\u00f3n{{\\\/link}} aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed.\"],\"Stats: Info popover content when the file downloads module has data.\\u0004Most {{link}}downloaded files{{\\\/link}} from your site.\":[\"Los {{link}}archivos m\u00e1s descargados{{\\\/link}} de tu sitio.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the file downloads module is empty\\u0004Your most {{link}}downloaded files{{\\\/link}} will display here.\":[\"Los {{link}}archivos m\u00e1s descargados{{\\\/link}} aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the file downloads module is empty\\u0004Stats from any {{link}}downloaded files{{\\\/link}} will display here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed te esperan las estad\u00edsticas de los {{link}}archivos descargados{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Header popower information when the Emails module has data.\\u0004{{link}}Latest emails sent{{\\\/link}} and their performance.\":[\"Los {{link}}\u00faltimos correos electr\u00f3nicos enviados{{\\\/link}} y su rendimiento.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Emails module is empty\\u0004Your {{link}}latest emails sent{{\\\/link}} will display here to better understand how they performed. Start sending!\":[\"Los {{link}}\u00faltimos correos electr\u00f3nicos enviados{{\\\/link}} aparecer\u00e1n aqu\u00ed para que puedas comprender mejor qu\u00e9 tal lo han hecho. \u00a1Env\u00eda alguno!\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for Regions\\\/Cities module when the module has data\\u0004Countries and their subdivisions are based on {{link}}ISO 3166{{\\\/link}} standards.\":[\"Los pa\u00edses y sus subdivisiones se basan en las normas {{link}}ISO 3166{{\\\/link}}.\"],\"Stats: Button link to show more detailed stats information\\u0004View all\":[\"Ver todo\"],\"Stats: Button label to see the detailed content of a panel\\u0004View details\":[\"Ver detalles\"],\"Stats: Link in a popover for the Referrers when the module has data\\u0004Websites {{link}}referring visitors{{\\\/link}} sorted by most clicked. Learn about where your audience comes from.\":[\"Las webs que {{link}}refieren visitantes{{\\\/link}} ordenadas de m\u00e1s a menos clics. Conoce de d\u00f3nde proviene tu audiencia.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Referrers module is empty\\u0004We\u0027ll show you which websites are {{link}}referring visitors{{\\\/link}} to your site so you can discover where your audience comes from. Start sharing!\":[\"Descubre qu\u00e9 webs est\u00e1n {{link}}refiriendo visitantes{{\\\/link}} a tu sitio para que sepas de d\u00f3nde procede tu audiencia. \u00a1Empieza a compartir! \"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Referrers module is empty\\u0004We\u0027ll show you which websites are {{link}}referring visitors{{\\\/link}} to your site.\":[\"Descubre qu\u00e9 webs est\u00e1n {{link}}refiriendo visitantes{{\\\/link}} a tu sitio.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Search module is empty\\u0004Learn about {{link}}popular terms{{\\\/link}} visitors use to find your site content on search engines.\":[\"Inf\u00f3rmate sobre los {{link}}t\u00e9rminos m\u00e1s populares{{\\\