percent)s de vistas\"],\"Stats: Info box label for the Total views card\\u0004{{link}}Learn about view patterns{{\\\/link}} by analyzing total and average daily views on your site.\":[\"{{link}}Conoce los patrones de visualizaci\u00f3n{{\\\/link}} analizando las vistas diarias totales y medias de tu sitio.\"],\"Legend label in stats post trends visualization\\u0004Fewer Posts\":[\"Menos entradas\"],\"Legend label in stats post trends visualization\\u0004More Posts\":[\"M\u00e1s entradas\"],\"pagination\\u0004Showing %(startIndex)s - %(endIndex)s of %(total)s %(itemType)s subscribers\":[\"Mostrando %(startIndex)s - %(endIndex)s de %(total)s %(itemType)s suscriptores\"],\"Date range for which stats are being displayed\\u0004%(number)s days ending %(endDate)s (Summarized)\":[\"%(number)s d\u00edas, hasta el %(endDate)s (resumen)\"],\"Date range for which stats are being displayed\\u0004%(startDate)s - %(endDate)s\":[\"%(startDate)s - %(endDate)s\"],\"Stats: Main stats page heading\\u0004{{prefix}}Stats for {{\\\/prefix}}{{period\\\/}}\":[\"{{prefix}}Estad\u00edsticas de {{\\\/prefix}}{{period\\\/}}\"],\"May abbreviation\\u0004May\":[\"May\"],\"Stats: No change in stats value from prior period\\u0004No change\":[\"Sin cambios\"],\"Action shown in stats to download data as csv.\\u0004Download CSV\":[\"Descargar CSV\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the email Countries module is empty\\u0004Clicks by countries will appear here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed aparecer\u00e1 el n\u00famero de clics por pa\u00eds.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the email Countries module is empty\\u0004Opens by countries will appear here.\":[\"Aqu\u00ed aparecer\u00e1 el n\u00famero de aperturas por pa\u00eds.\"],\"Stats: Header popover information when the Subscribers module has data.\\u0004{{link}}Latest subscribers{{\\\/link}} and when they subscribed.\":[\"{{link}}\u00daltimos suscriptores{{\\\/link}} y cu\u00e1ndo se suscribieron.\"],\"Stats: Info box label when the Subscribers module is empty\\u0004Onc