r en el generador de URL UTM\"],\"Label for hidden menu in a list on the Stats page.\\u0004Show Actions\":[\"Mostrar acciones\"],\"Stats: Descriptive text in the purchase flow\\u0004Unlock UTM stats, device stats, and region and city stats with a paid plan.\":[\"Desbloquea las estad\u00edsticas de UTM, por dispositivo y por regi\u00f3n y ciudad con un plan de pago.\"],\"Sum of earnings that have been distributed\\u0004Total paid\":[\"Total pagado\"],\"Sum earnings left unpaid\\u0004Outstanding amount\":[\"Cantidad pendiente\"],\"percent\\u0004%(percentage)s%% \":[\"%(percentage)s\u00a0%% \"],\"dismiss button\\u0004Got it\":[\"Vale\"],\"Button to preview a theme\\u0004Preview\":[\"Previsualizar\"],\"singular noun, the currently active theme\\u0004Active\":[\"Activo\"],\"profile stats: count of accounts followed\\u0004following\":[\"siguiendo\"],\"latest blog posts\\u0004Latest\":[\"Recientes\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004Connecting %(service)s\":[\"Conectando %(service)s\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s connection could not be made because no account was selected.\":[\"No se ha podido realizar la conexi\u00f3n de %(service)s porque no hab\u00eda ninguna cuenta seleccionada.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s connection could not be made because all available accounts are already connected.\":[\"No se ha podido realizar la conexi\u00f3n de %(service)s porque ya estaban conectadas todas las cuentas disponibles.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was successfully connected.\":[\"La cuenta de %(service)s se ha conectado de forma correcta.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was successfully disconnected.\":[\"La cuenta de %(service)s se ha desconectado correctamente.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was unable to be disconnected.\":[\"No se ha podido desconectar la cuenta de %(service)s.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004An error occurred while connecting the account.\":[\"Se ha producido un error al conectar la cuenta.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was successfully updated.\":[\"La cuenta de %(service)s se ha actualizado correctamente.\"],\"Sharing: connections\\u0004Connected by %(username)s\":[\"Conectado por %(username)s\"],\"Sharing: Publicize\\u0004Connection available to all administrators, editors, and authors\":[\"La conexi\u00f3n est\u00e1 disponible para todos los administradores, editores y autores\"],\"Sharing: Publicize\\u0004There is an issue connecting to %(service)s.\":[\"Existe un problema en la conexi\u00f3n a %(service)s.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize status pending button label\\u0004Loading\u2026\":[\"Cargando...\"],\"Sharing: Publicize disconnect pending button label\\u0004Disconnecting\u2026\":[\"Desconectando\u2026\"],\"Sharing: Publicize reconnect pending button label\\u0004Reconnecting\u2026\":[\"Conectando de nuevo\u2026\"],\"Sharing: Publicize reconnect pending button label\\u0004Reconnect\":[\"Conectar de nuevo\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connect pending button label\\u0004Connecting\u2026\":[\"Conectando\u2026\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connect pending button label\\u0004Connect\":[\"Conectar\"],\"Sharing: Publicize disconnect button label\\u0004Disconnect All\":[\"Desconectar todo\"],\"Sharing: Publicize disconnect button label\\u0004Disconnect\":[\"Desconectar\"],\"Sharing: Publicize connect unavailable button label\\u0004Unavailable\":[\"No disponible\"],\"Sharing: Tip in settings\\u0004You can also add a {{widgetLink}}Twitter Timeline Widget{{\\\/widgetLink}} to display any public timeline on your site.\":[\"Tambi\u00e9n puedes a\u00f1adir un {{widgetLink}}widget de la l\u00ednea de tiempo de Twitter{{\\\/widgetLink}} para mostrar cualquier l\u00ednea de tiempo p\u00fablica en tu sitio.\"],\"Sharing: Tip in settings\\u0004You can also add an {{widgetLink}}Instagram Widget{{\\\/widgetLink}} to display your latest Instagram photos on your site.\":[\"Tambi\u00e9n puedes a\u00f1adir un {{widgetLink}}widget de Instagram{{\\\/widgetLink}} para mostrar tus fotos de Instagram m\u00e1s recientes en el sitio.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize reconnection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was unable to be reconnected.\":[\"No se ha podido volver a conectar la cuenta de %(service)s.\"],\"Sharing: Publicize reconnection confirmation\\u0004The %(service)s account was unable to be updated.\":[\"No se ha podido actualizar la cuenta de %(service)s.\"],\"Sharing: Jetpack Social connection error\\u0004The Google Drive connection could not be made.\":[\"No se ha podido realizar la conexi\u00f3n de Google Drive.\"],\"Sharing options: Checkbox label\\u0004Show reblog button\":[\"Mostrar el bot\u00f3n de reblogueo\"],\"Sharing options: Checkbox label\\u0004Show like button\":[\"Mostrar el bot\u00f3n \u00abMe gusta\u00bb\"],\"Sharing options: Header\\u0004Like\":[\"Me gusta\"],\"Sharing options: Header\\u0004Reblog & Like\":[\"Rebloguear y \u00abMe gusta\u00bb\"],\"Sharing options: Header\\u0004Comment Likes\":[\"\u00abMe gusta\u00bb de los comentarios\"],\"Sharing options: Header\\u0004Show like and sharing buttons on\":[\"Muestra los botones de compartir y Me gusta en:\"],\"Sharing: Buttons\\u0004This text won\u0027t appear until you add at least one sharing button.\":[\"Este texto no aparecer\u00e1 hasta que a\u00f1adas al menos un bot\u00f3n de compartir.\"],\"Sharing: Buttons\\u0004It looks like your site is Private. Make it Public to take advantage of more sharing options.\":[\"Parece que tu sitio es Privado. Hazlo P\u00fablico para acceder a m\u00e1s opciones para compartir.\"],\"Sharing: Buttons\\u0004Check out our guide for more details.\":[\"\u00c9chale un vistazo a nuestra gu\u00eda para obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n.\"],\"Sharing: buttons\\u0004Edit label text\":[\"Editar texto de etiqueta\